    "files": {
        "brand_guidelines.txt": "Brand Voice Guidelines for Tecnoprism Proposals\n\n1. Professional and Authoritative: Speak as an industry expert. Use clear, concise language without being overly academic or dry.\n2. Confident and Assured: Emphasize our track record of success. Use active voice (e.g., \"We will implement...\" rather than \"It will be implemented...\").\n3. Client-Centric: Focus on the value and ROI for the client, not just the technical features. Always tie technical choices back to business outcomes.\n4. Modern and Forward-Thinking: Use contemporary terminology (e.g., \"cloud-native\", \"AI-driven\") where appropriate, but avoid empty buzzwords.\n5. Tone: Approachable, collaborative, and highly competent.\n",
        "company_profile.txt": "Company Profile: Tecnoprism\n\nAbout Us\nTecnoprism is a forward-thinking technology consulting and software development firm dedicated to driving digital transformation. Founded in 2015, we specialize in building scalable, secure, and modern enterprise solutions using cutting-edge cloud native architectures and generative AI.\n\nCore Values\nInnovation First: We leverage the latest technologies to solve complex business problems.\nClient Success: We measure our success by the tangible ROI we deliver to our partners.\nUncompromising Quality: Security, scalability, and performance are built-in, not bolted on.\n\nKey Capabilities\nCloud Architecture & Migration (AWS, Azure, GCP)\nArtificial Intelligence & Machine Learning Integrations\nCustom Enterprise Software Development\nData Engineering & Analytics\nCyber Security & Compliance\n\nPast Performance Highlights\nSuccessfully delivered a modern SaaS platform for a Fortune 500 logistics company, reducing operational overhead by 30%.\nModernized legacy on-premise infrastructure for a major healthcare provider, achieving full HIPAA compliance and zero downtime during migration.\n"
